uld close it.","The business throws off $18M in free cash flow, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders. Cash conversion is thin at 0.17\u00d7, however, which raises the oldest question in analysis: are these earnings backed by cash?.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.4\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 5.6% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 3.0% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (30.3% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Broad market in a downtrend, trading below its 200-day average","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 43% margin of safety to estim